Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
NeedsCleaning                      	N/A                 	N/A       
NumberOfMediaSupported             	N/A                 	N/A       
PNPDeviceID                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Partitions                         	N/A                 	N/A       
PowerManagementCapabilities        	N/A                 	N/A       
PowerManagementSupported           	N/A                 	N/A       
SCSIBus                            	N/A                 	N/A       
SCSILogicalUnit                    	N/A                 	N/A       
SCSIPort                           	N/A                 	N/A       
SCSITargetId                       	N/A                 	N/A       
SectorsPerTrack                    	N/A                 	N/A       
Signature                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Size                               	N/A                 	N/A       
Status                             	N/A                 	N/A       
